### 5. 로그아웃 요청
POST {{host}}/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf_token}}
Cookie: accessToken={{access_token}}; refreshToken={{refresh_token}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf_token}}
